Here is the public domain version of Atari's arcade game
"STARGATE". It requires an IBM PC with a color graphics
card. This file has been uuencoded so to unpack it, cut it
at the mark and type

% uudecode <filename>

where <filename> is the name you saved the cut file. It will
then create the file stargate.com which you can then download
to the IBM PC with KERMIT or XMODEM in binary file transfer 
mode. I downloaded this off a PC bulletin board at (718) 624-9141.
For those without Unix and thus without uudecode, I have no
solution.

                                    Have fun,
                                   Sam Chin
                                   allegra!cmcl2!acf4!tsc2597

